<title>POLAND: Polish average wage rises to PLN 1,107 in April.</title>
<headline>Polish average wage rises to PLN 1,107 in April.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish average gross wage in the enterprise sector rose to 1,107 zlotys in April from 1,073 zlotys in March, and was 20.5 percent higher than a year ago, the Central Statistical Office said.</p>
<p> POLISH AVERAGE WAGES     APRIL	  MARCH	   APRIL 96</p>
<p> average mthly wage PLN   1,107	 1,073	     918</p>
